id=nh_audit_execute_dontaudit
name=NetHunter Audit Execute Flood Fix
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=NetHunter Operator
description=Potlacuje SELinux "avc: granted execute" audit zahlceni z PRoot exec retezu (proot -> ld-linux-aarch64.so.1 -> loader -> binarka), ktere jinak preplni kernel audit_backlog_limit (64) a audit_rate_limit (5/s) a muze zamrznout cely system (system_server vcetne), ne jen appku. Jen dontaudit na jiz POVOLENYCH akcich - nemeni zadne opravneni.
minMagisk=20400
